mode: "100644"
text: "# The WAVES framework — turn one episode into a week of social\n\nThe tools clip/generate; the agent picks the moments + brands + writes the hooks/CTAs + plans the cadence;\n**WoopSocial publishes the finished clips/audiograms**; the **full episode lives on the podcast host.**\n\n## W — Winnow to the best moments\n- Use **retention spikes** (Spotify/YouTube Studio = replayed moments) + the **timestamped transcript** to\n  pick **5–8** standout moments/episode (strong claims, data, reactions, stories). Don't re-listen — the\n  transcript is the map. AI virality scores are a **starting point.**\n\n## A — Aim the format to what you recorded\n- **Video-podcast clip** (9:16, reframe to the active speaker) if you have video; **audiogram** (cover art +\n  animated waveform + captions) if **audio-only** — but video clips outperform audiograms, so prefer video\n  when it exists and design audiograms caption-first (waveform as support); **quote card** for a single line\n  (→ `design-and-templates`).\n\n## V — Voice the hook + captions\n- **First-3-sec hook** on every clip; **captions on every clip** (85% sound-off — non-optional). The\n  video-clip **caption burn-in** → `captions-and-clipping` / `clipping.md`.\n\n## E — Endcap with a reason to listen\n- **Strategic CTA:** give a **reason** to watch the full episode (a teaser/cliffhanger — \"find out why the\n  guest changed their mind…\"), not \"check out the full episode.\" **Link to the episode on the host**; SEO\n  keywords in description/tags.\n\n## S — Spread on a schedule\n- **WoopSocial publishes** the finished clips/audiograms across platforms on a **cadence** (episode → clips →\n  quote cards → carousel). One episode → a week+ of content (→ `content-recycling`/`cross-platform-\n  repurposing`). **The full episode stays on the podcast host.**\n\n## The per-episode clip plan a request should fill\n```\nSOURCE: episode + transcript; retention spikes (Spotify/YouTube Studio); video or audio-only?\nMOMENTS (5-8): timestamp | one-line why-it-lands | format (clip / audiogram / quote card)\nPER ASSET: hook (first 3s) | captions (always) | branding (logo/colors/template) | aspect (9:16 / 1:1 / etc.)\nCTA: a REASON to watch the full ep (teaser/cliffhanger) + link to the host\nCADENCE (WoopSocial): which clip posts which day, across which platforms (episode -> clips -> quote -> carousel)\nTOOLS: clip (Opus Clip/Choppity) or audiogram (Headliner/Podsqueeze); burn-in -> captions-and-clipping. WoopSocial publishes; it doesn't clip/host. Never fabricate virality.\n```\n"
